---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---
<div class="wiki-gem-card">
  <header><img src={`${base}images/gems/frostblink.png`} width="44" height="44" alt="" /><div><strong>Frostblink</strong><span>Active skill gem · Levels 1–20</span></div></header>
  <div class="gem-card-body">
    <p class="tags">Spell, Movement, Duration, Cold, Travel, Blink, AoE</p>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Gem level</dt><dd>1–20</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Mana cost</dt><dd>12–22</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Cooldown</dt><dd>3.00–2.60 seconds</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Cast time</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Critical strike chance</dt><dd>7.50%</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Added damage effectiveness</dt><dd>180–250%</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="requirements">Requires character level <b>4–70</b> and <b>16–155 Intelligence</b></p>
    <p class="description">Teleport a short distance. Enemies near either endpoint take cold damage, and chilled ground remains behind. Other Blink skills share its cooldown.</p>
    <ul class="stats">
      <li>Cold damage: 9–14 at level 1; 1,144–1,716 at level 20</li>
      <li>Ground duration: 3 seconds</li>
      <li>Additional radius: 0–0.3 metres</li>
      <li>Cooldown recovery per normal or magic enemy nearby: +15–19%</li>
      <li>Cooldown recovery per rare or unique enemy nearby: +80–99%</li>
      <li>Maximum travel distance: +0–38%</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="quality"><span>Quality · 1–20%</span><p>Maximum travel distance: +0.5–10%</p></div>
    <footer><a href="https://www.poewiki.net/wiki/Frostblink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Full details on PoE Wiki ↗</a><span>Ranges show gem levels 1–20 · Current wiki data</span></footer>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .wiki-gem-card { width: 100%; max-width: 440px; background: #090d12; border: 1px solid #344b5b; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #0007; color: #ccd1d5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; text-align: left; }
  header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b424e; background: #101e26; }
  header img { display: block; object-fit: contain; flex: none; }
  header strong { display: block; font-family: var(--header-font); color: #58a6ff; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 550; }
  header span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #8fa1ae; margin-top: 4px; }
  .gem-card-body { padding: 11px 14px; }
  .tags { color: #93abbf; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  dl { margin: 0; }
  dl > div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 10px; margin: 2px 0; }
  dt { color: #9ba6af; }
  dd { margin: 0; color: #e0e3e5; }
  .requirements { border-top: 1px solid #25333e; border-bottom: 1px solid #25333e; padding: 8px 0; margin: 10px 0; color: #9ba6af; font-size: 13px; }
  .requirements b { color: #cbd5dc; font-weight: 400; }
  .description { color: #85b6bd; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .stats { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #9eaaf4; }
  .stats li { padding: 0; margin: 4px 0; }
  .quality { border-top: 1px solid #25333e; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 8px; }
  .quality > span { color: #a1a9b3; font-size: 12px; }
  .quality p { margin: 3px 0; color: #9eaaf4; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid #25333e; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 8px; }
  footer a { display: block; color: var(--accent-light); font-size: 12px; }
  footer span { display: block; color: #87929c; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 5px; }
</style>
